Subject: [PATCH] Accept One UI 9.5 with the One UI 9 camera contract

The current One UI 9 Camera enum only knows V9_0. Accept the reviewed 90500
ROM profile using that camera capability level. Preserve the original
lookup and rejection behavior for every other version; do not alter props.

diff --git a/smali_classes2/e5/m.smali b/smali_classes2/e5/m.smali
--- a/smali_classes2/e5/m.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/e5/m.smali
@@ -527,6 +527,17 @@
 .method public static a(I)Le5/m;
     .locals 5
 
+    # The QPR2 ROM keeps Samsung's reviewed One UI 9 camera contract.
+    # Accept its One UI 9.5 version without inventing a new Samsung API enum.
+    const v0, 0x16184
+
+    if-ne p0, v0, :unica_exact_oneui_version
+
+    sget-object v0, Le5/m;->V9_0:Le5/m;
+
+    return-object v0
+
+    :unica_exact_oneui_version
     invoke-static {}, Le5/m;->values()[Le5/m;
 
     move-result-object v0
